    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>One night when you can't sleep, a dream spirit visits you, and offers to help you remember your beautiful life.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mystery &amp; Intrigue: </strong>Discover Maya's story, by piecing together her memories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flowing &amp; relaxing: </strong> reimagination of jigsaw puzzle that feels flowing and wholesome.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Maya's Room:</strong> Transform Maya's room by unlocking keepsakes as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created by a BAFTA Nominated filmmaker.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PIECE TOGETHER MAYA'S MEMORIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A reimagination of jigsaw puzzles where you piece together Maya's story through her lost memories. Lose yourself in layered, flowing, and wholesome gameplay that transforms as you play.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/6c12e5daef225693d354a4fcaa4182c6.poster.avif?t=1746111560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/6c12e5daef225693d354a4fcaa4182c6.webm?t=1746111560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/6c12e5daef225693d354a4fcaa4182c6.mp4?t=1746111560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRANSFORM HER ROOM WITH HER KEEPSAKES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Collect memory shards and use it to transform Maya's room into a cosy space that reflects her beautiful full life. Help Maya discover that her life was never truly empty, but vibrant with meaning.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/b9ae6d49be8325b136f5661616b6ab29.poster.avif?t=1746111560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/b9ae6d49be8325b136f5661616b6ab29.webm?t=1746111560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/b9ae6d49be8325b136f5661616b6ab29.mp4?t=1746111560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCOVER A STORY OF MYSTERY AND INTRIGUE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Piece together over 17 chapter of her life, discover her beautiful story. Discover a secret about her life that is filled with mystery and intrigue.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/279841ffc9398ad75fcdc59cb569969d.avif?t=1746111560\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each puzzle is a memory of Maya that you piece together to discover her story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story about belonging, love, loss and meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game that explores the effects of mental degeneration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206730/extras/ecc5e8d717657a6048118e22d32df9eb.avif?t=1746111560\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>From the Dev</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Emerge is a game I created during a deeply personal experience caring for my grandmother during her neurodegenerative decline. This game is an exploration of the nature of memories, and what it means to lose them.\u00a0 I'm a solo dev from Edinburgh, Scotland. I hope you enjoy Emerge.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AI Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game does not use any generative AI content.</i> </p>",
